              "creator": "ctanase@mozilla.com",
              "id": 17321887,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 133.0/134/136\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Must be logged in with a google account\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook\n2. Open a note or create a new one. (Click on the \"+ Create new\" button -> Click on \"Copied text\" from \"Paste text\" -> Type a subject or paste any relevant text and click \"Insert\")\n3. Click on \"Interactive mode (BETA)\" button located on the right side of the page below the \"Audio Overview\" section. (button is only visible if the conversation was generated, if you did not generate it yet, click on \"Generate\" and the button will appear afterwards)\n4. Wait for it to load. (it might load slower, if it fails to load, refresh the page and try again)\n5. Click the play button.\n6. Click on \"Join\".\n7. Observe the behavior.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nAble to to speak.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nStuck loading.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/146005",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "**Environment:**\nOperating system: Windows 10\nFirefox version: Firefox 133.0/134/136\n\n**Preconditions:**\n- Must be logged in with a google account\n\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go to https://notebooklm.google.com/notebook\n2. Open a note or create a new one. (Click on the \"+ Create new\" button -> Click on \"Copied text\" from \"Paste text\" -> Type a subject or paste any relevant text and click \"Insert\")\n3. Click on \"Interactive mode (BETA)\" button located on the right side of the page below the \"Audio Overview\" section. (button is only visible if the conversation was generated, if you did not generate it yet, click on \"Generate\" and the button will appear afterwards)\n4. Wait for it to load. (it might load slower, if it fails to load, refresh the page and try again)\n5. Click the play button.\n6. Click on \"Join\".\n7. Observe the behavior.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nAble to to speak.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nStuck loading.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Reproduces regardless of the status of ETP\n- Reproduces in firefox-nightly, and firefox-release\n- Does not reproduce in chrome\n\nCreated from https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/146005",
              "time": "2025-01-29T13:06:44Z"
            },
